# OCR Service - Handwritten Documents Test Data
# =============================================

# Exclude all binary document files from version control to prevent repository bloat
# These files should be downloaded separately from the secure document storage
# See README.md for instructions on obtaining test documents

# Document file formats
*.pdf
*.PDF
*.tiff
*.TIFF
*.tif
*.TIF
*.png
*.PNG
*.jpg
*.JPG
*.jpeg
*.JPEG

# Exclude temporary files that might be created during testing
*.tmp
*.temp

# Exclude any extracted text files that might contain sensitive information
*.txt
*.json

# Exceptions - Files that should be tracked in version control
!README.md
!config.json
!metadata.json
!document_catalog.csv
!sample_structure.md

# Include placeholder files to maintain directory structure
!.placeholder

# Note: To obtain the actual test documents, please follow these steps:
# 1. Request access to the secure document storage from the project administrator
# 2. Download the handwritten_documents.zip package from the shared storage location
# 3. Extract the contents to this directory
# 4. Verify the extraction by running the document validation script: 
#    python ../../test_utils/validate_test_documents.py
#
# DO NOT commit the actual document files to version control!
# The OCR service tests will automatically detect and use these files when present.